            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko yabacishije bugufi, yemera ko musonza, araheza abagaburira manu mutāri muzi, na ba sogokuruza banyu batigeze kumenya; kugira ngw abamenyeshe yuk’ umuntu adatungwa n’ivyo kurya gusa, arikw atungwa n’amajambo yose ava mu kanwa k’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 29:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.9.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 9:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impuzu zanyu ntizabashiriyeko, cank’ ibirenge vyanyu ngo bivyimbe, iyi myaka ukw ari mirongwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
