        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko muze mwibuke Uhoraho Imana yanyu, kukw ari we azobaha ubutōre bgo kuronka ubutunzi, kugira ngw ashitse isezerano yasezeranye arahira ba sogokuruza banyu, nk’uko biri n’uyu musi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.18",
